      "description": "Recommendation 1: On California inpatient cesarean-delivery claims, deny the incremental complication-based payment and reprice at the lower-severity inpatient rate when O14.15, O99.345, or O85 is not clearly supported in the record as present and clinically managed during the admission. Apply to CA.\n\nIA \u2014 For California inpatient cesarean-delivery claims, require prepay clinical validation before allowing complication-driven case-mix or severity uplift when O14.15, O99.345, or O85 is reported as a secondary diagnosis, and prioritize reviews when those diagnoses move the stay to a higher-paid inpatient level. (CA)",
